<theodulf. carm. 52.1>	Ecce nugax labiis filo quidam certa susurrans
<theodulf. carm. 52.2>	Nunc ioca, nunc fletus, nunc quoque turpe canit.
<theodulf. carm. 52.3>	Blanditias tremulat, volitat nunc more cicadae:
<theodulf. carm. 52.4>	Auribus ingeminat, quas petit ortivagus.
<theodulf. carm. 52.5>	Dura satis rostro ceu pulsat pectora cornix,
<theodulf. carm. 52.6>	Imbriferos fluxus cum vocat ore procax;
<theodulf. carm. 52.7>	Aut rapidis pressas pennis lustrare lacunas
<theodulf. carm. 52.8>	Temptat hirundo celer dulcia voce canens:
<theodulf. carm. 52.9>	Haud secus instabiles percurrit elluo mentes
<theodulf. carm. 52.10>	Infestus iuvenum, quos agit aura levis.
